url: "https://sterling-group.github.io/ChemRefine/"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# Concept (all-versions) DOI: always resolves to the latest release, so cutting a
# tag never requires touching this file. `version:` and `date-released:` are
# deliberately omitted for the same reason — the only edit this file should ever
# need is a new paper (update preferred-citation and the author order to match).
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.17187168
keywords:
  - computational chemistry
  - machine-learned interatomic potentials
  - quantum chemistry
  - conformer sampling
  - workflow automation
preferred-citation:
  type: article
